{"lines":[["L","[excited] Girl, sit down. The internet had a meltdown Wednesday."],["J","[gasps] Spill."],["L","PHP, which runs most of the web, got two critical bugs. Strangers can run code on your server, no login."],["J","[shocked] No login?"],["L","And the details leaked before the patch was out. So the NSA goes..."],["NSA","[firmly] Take your system offline."],["L","The FBI goes..."],["FBI","[firmly] Take your system offline."],["L","The U.K. goes..."],["UK","[firmly] Take your system offline."],["L","Then Japan's Prime Minister posts on X at ten p.m., like, patch tonight."],["J","[laughs] The actual Prime Minister?"],["L","The actual Prime Minister. So everyone goes dark. The Dutch cyber agency took down its own site."],["J","[incredulous] Its OWN site?"],["L","Finland. Archive dot org. Asana. Gone. And babe? That was just PHP."],["J","[whispers] There's more?"],["L","[fast] GitLab drops a perfect ten for a bug from twenty fourteen. Lite L L M ships a credential stealer. Railway freezes every deploy."],["J","[sighs] I need to rotate my entire life."],["L","[mischievously] Okay, my favorite. A certificate authority. Sixty million certs. Their private keys should be random numbers over a hundred digits long."],["J","[curious] Yeah?"],["L","[deadpan] One of them was four."],["J","Four?"],["L","Just four."],["J","[laughs] Anyway. That was Wednesday."],["L","Patch your PHP, babe."]],"voices":{"L":"FGY2WhTYpPnrIDTdsKH5","J":"cgSgspJ2msm6clMCkdW9","NSA":"EXAVITQu4vr4xnSDxMaL","FBI":"XrExE9yKIg1WjnnlVkGX","UK":"Xb7hH8MSUJpSbSDYk0k2"},"alignment":{"characters":["[","e","x","c","i","t","e","d","]"," ","G","i","r","l",","," ","s","i","t"," ","d","o","w","n","."," ","T","h","e"," ","i","n","t","e","r","n","e","t"," ","h","a","d"," ","a"," ","m","e","l","t","d","o","w","n"," ","W","e","d","n","e","s","d","a","y",".","[","g","a","s","p","s","]"," ","S","p","i","l","l",".","P","H","P",","," ","w","h","i","c","h"," ","r","u","n","s"," ","m","o","s","t"," ","o","f"," ","t","h"